        <entry>
          <string>Description</string>
          <string>P35 Cache tag store - Digital task
Scaled: 4 lines (index = addr[3:2]), tag = addr[7:4]; valid bits and tags in D flip-flops, a Comparator per line or one after a multiplexer.
Allowed parts: all of the above + Add, Sub, Comparator, Neg
Do not rename, move or delete the input and output pins.</string>
        </entry>
      </elementAttributes>
      <pos x="100" y="40"/>
