          <string>P35 Cache Tag Store (scaled 4-line version)
Address split: tag=addr[7:4], index=addr[3:2], offset=addr[1:0].
Each line stores a 4-bit tag and one valid bit.
Each access fills the selected line on the rising clock edge.
</string>
